1
00:00:00,334 --> 00:00:02,436
Hi! I've been spending most of this year

2
00:00:02,436 --> 00:00:05,839
on a campaign to stop the
destruction of video games.

3
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:07,441
The short version of what is going on is

4
00:00:07,441 --> 00:00:10,644
more and more games are being
designed with "kill switches".

5
00:00:10,644 --> 00:00:13,480
So, you buy a game, then
later the company decides,

6
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:17,284
"Nah, we're going to disable your
game...and everybody else's copy."

7
00:00:17,284 --> 00:00:19,086
It's planned obsolesence.

8
00:00:19,086 --> 00:00:22,222
Well, we've launched a
European Citizens' Initiative

9
00:00:22,222 --> 00:00:25,467
which would introduce new
law in the EU to stop this.

10
00:00:25,467 --> 00:00:28,334
And if we get enough
signatures--one million...

11
00:00:28,334 --> 00:00:30,063
...yeah, I know...

12
00:00:30,063 --> 00:00:32,499
then there's a real chance
this could pass into law.

13
00:00:32,499 --> 00:00:34,968
And we have time to do it--one year.

14
00:00:34,968 --> 00:00:37,804
Go to stopkillinggames.com.
It'll tell you what to do.

15
00:00:37,804 --> 00:00:40,374
It's only for EU citizens, I'm afraid,

16
00:00:40,374 --> 00:00:43,443
but we all win if Europeans
can come through on this.

17
00:00:43,443 --> 00:00:47,281
Get everybody you can to sign
it--friends, family, whoever.

18
00:00:47,281 --> 00:00:50,684
Sign this if you don't like
having things you own destroyed

19
00:00:50,684 --> 00:00:53,053
either now or in the future.

20
00:00:53,053 --> 00:00:56,089
I don't know how much more
simple I can make this.

21
00:00:56,089 --> 00:00:59,293
Yeah, I guess if you like having
things you own taken from you,

22
00:00:59,293 --> 00:01:01,795
don't sign this initiative.
You won't like it.

23
00:01:01,795 --> 00:01:06,166
Yeah, what is it, peasant mentality?
Is that what that's called?

24
00:01:06,166 --> 00:01:09,436
All right, that's it! Go to
stopkillinggames.com!

25
00:01:09,436 --> 00:01:11,538
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

